  "CDATA.labour[3].channel": "4S dealer",
  "CDATA.labour[3].note": "Worked out per visit, this saves 15%–20% against buying each service separately.",
  "CDATA.labour[4].type": "Minor service (oil and three-filter package)",
  "CDATA.labour[4].channel": "Tuhu / chains",
  "CDATA.labour[4].note": "Tuhu's oil and three-filter package is 407 CNY (about 880 CNY for the equivalent at a 4S dealer); an oil change including labour does not exceed 200 CNY; a single minor-service voucher is 169 CNY.",
